#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:35
#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:36
#: 3f720695dc904513925375c5acaea75e 8412f6efec40428abb8067a2e64d140e
#: 8f99ce68065d47a9ba74bc31b9317d34 9c975e979c354b92bdaaa99261dbc96f
#: a39ae7063cc14d39933989649a99c459 ab3cf475dfdc400bbbcb67e97249c4da
msgid ""
"**Applets** which are scripts that require no user editing before use, can "
"be found `here "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/applets>`_"
" for the \"latest\" firmware branch, and may require code extensions "
"included in that branch to function properly. Each of these has a .md file "
"of the same name detailing its capabilities, use, and setup. For example, "
"there is a script to allow a user to change a SmartAudio capable video "
"transmitter's output power level from a transmitter channel and set its "
"power-up value via parameter. See :ref:`common-scripting-applets`."
msgstr ""
"**应用程序** （无需用户编辑即可使用的脚本）可在 `此处 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/applets>`_"
" 找到（「最新」固件分支），可能需要该分支中包含的代码扩展才能正常工作。每个脚本都有同名的 .md "
"文件，详细说明其功能、使用方法和设置。例如，有一个脚本允许用户通过遥控器通道更改支持 SmartAudio 的图传输出功率，并通过参数设置上电值。参见 "
":ref:`common-scripting-applets`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:37
#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:38
#: 03a89b027ebf4e81aa4620cf906e0b2d 3e8f54636d364cc694d919ac691ec4af
#: 56006a9cd6014a5e8b58a629edc6ca7e 8b590382f4de4ce093a94fcc09de09c8
#: 93bc089e2c094bdd9be0fd06f20a17db fb24a721be0d4629b3120b1f57590b77
msgid ""
"**Drivers** Lua scripts can actually provide hardware drivers for new "
"peripheral hardware that is not directly supported in the ArduPilot "
"firmware, such a new EFIs or Gimbals. Examples of these can be found `here "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/drivers>`__"
" for the \"latest\" firmware branch, and may require code extensions "
"included in that branch to function properly."
msgstr ""
"**驱动程序** Lua 脚本实际上可以为 ArduPilot 固件不直接支持的新外设硬件（如新的 EFI 或云台）提供硬件驱动。这些示例可在 `此处 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/drivers>`__"
" 找到（「最新」固件分支），可能需要该分支中包含的代码扩展才能正常工作。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:39
#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:40
#: 280cff3b594749c4af3a451147d0c633 2c453448d54b404a98bb2d61bcac7c09
#: 4cda2e3554744386b26bd48d3ab3dfaf b00e3b3de0ab491cb3145cdfe560b467
#: bed021496eca455baf57ad54274586a0 e60451a511824a17a2cf313ced5e229b
msgid ""
"To download from the github locations, first click the script name, then "
"select \"raw\" in upper right corner, then right mouse click to \"Save Page "
"as\" a text file with the \".lua\" file extension"
msgstr ""
"要从 GitHub 位置下载，先点击脚本名称，然后在右上角选择 「raw」，再右键单击选择 「页面另存为」，保存为扩展名为 「.lua」 的文本文件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:41
#: 3d8d2c8a3f8b499ea1a61be9207d367e
msgid ""
"Up to 8 RC channels can be assigned as scripting inputs/controls using "
"the``RCX_OPTION`` = \"300-307\" options to be used by scripts. In addition, "
"four dedicated script parameters are available: :ref:`SCR_USER1<SCR_USER1>` "
"thru :ref:`SCR_USER4<SCR_USER4>` and are accessed with the same method as "
"any other parameter, but these are reserved for script use. Scripts can also"
" generate their own parameters (see :ref:`common-scripting-parameters`)to be"
" used within the scripts."
msgstr ""
"最多可以使用 ``RCX_OPTION`` = 「300-307」 选项将 8 个 RC "
"通道分配为脚本输入/控制，供脚本使用。此外，还有四个专用脚本参数可用：:ref:`SCR_USER1<SCR_USER1>` 到 "
":ref:`SCR_USER4<SCR_USER4>`，访问方式与其他参数相同，但这些参数保留供脚本使用。脚本还可以生成自己的参数（参见 "
":ref:`common-scripting-parameters`），供脚本内部使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:42
#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:43
#: 0a40343249ef46618f9c97c5dddc49b3 12194b20990b4916a9ddef0d5911add6
#: 134a187cbc0d48d2a4a302e015184c96 1ac137ef76034445bc6cf08f7c85d787
#: 5fe62bc115284c30b533a8115714f6a3 a9e560500407430b80c272411380c02f
msgid ""
"When the autopilot is powered on it will load and start all scripts. By "
"default it will look in the ROMFS file system for scripts included in the "
"firmware image by a manufacturer, and the APM/scripts directory on the SD "
"Card (or if a SITL simulation, the base directory where the simulation was "
"started.) This can be modified by used the "
":ref:`SCR_DIR_DISABLE<SCR_DIR_DISABLE>` parameter."
msgstr ""
"飞控上电时将加载并启动所有脚本。默认情况下，它会在 ROMFS 文件系统中查找制造商内嵌在固件镜像中的脚本，以及 SD 卡上的 APM/scripts "
"目录（或 SITL 仿真时，仿真启动的基础目录）。可以使用 :ref:`SCR_DIR_DISABLE<SCR_DIR_DISABLE>` "
"参数修改此行为。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:43
#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:44
#: 24c69760c5b14ed4b1cd666d96d63a1b 294d62311ff141bd8140826758ca05f7
#: 3690b416812f49f8ac8c6a7828a61d4b b22ee14b9e834a6e9f4ad1d55b606bbe
#: cd986e509fb84d2092ba627ba8f5a398 cfd841b281694458a98bf77a8ce8be27
msgid ""
"Messages and errors are sent to the ground station and, if using Mission "
"Planner, can be viewed in the Data screen's \"Messages\" tab."
msgstr "消息和错误会发送到地面站，如果使用 Mission Planner，可在数据界面的 「消息」 标签页中查看。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:44
#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:45
#: 150acc5eee7d463782b43c61627f5798 3d2fe1aeac2b4bf8a6964148250505bb
#: 5bd1131f028a4579bd9c68b31b44932d 6a54f6b1363d4791b3934306e9262a62
#: 6b6cf0aaef634723b65b7abf5c022e8f 8f6bde4e97d340aebf80d3e30bd7de44
msgid ""
":ref:`SCR_HEAP_SIZE <SCR_HEAP_SIZE>` can be adjusted to increase or decrease"
" the amount of memory available for scripts. The default , which varies from"
" 43K to 204.8K depending on cpu being used, is sufficient at its smallest "
"(43K) for small scripts, but many will require more (some applets now need "
"300K). The autopilot's free memory depends highly upon which features and "
"peripherals are enabled. If this parameter is set too low, scripts may fail "
"to run and give an out of memory pre-arm error. If set too high other "
"autopilot features such as Terrain Following or even the EKF may fail to "
"initialize. On autopilots with a STM32F4 microcontroller, Smart RTL (Rover, "
"Copter) and Terrain Following (Plane, Copter) need to be nearly always "
"disabled. These features are usually enabled by default, set "
":ref:`SRTL_POINTS <SRTL_POINTS>` = 0, :ref:`TERRAIN_ENABLE <TERRAIN_ENABLE>`"
" = 0). See also :ref:`RAM Limitations<ram_limitations>` section."
msgstr ""
":ref:`SCR_HEAP_SIZE <SCR_HEAP_SIZE>` 可以调整以增加或减少脚本可用内存。默认值因使用的 CPU 不同而异（43K 到"
" 204.8K），最小值（43K）足够小型脚本使用，但许多脚本需要更多（部分应用程序现在需要 "
"300K）。飞控的可用内存高度依赖于启用的功能和外设。如果该参数设置过低，脚本可能无法运行并出现内存不足的解锁前错误。如果设置过高，其他飞控功能（如地形跟随甚至"
" EKF）可能无法初始化。在基于 STM32F4 微控制器的飞控上，Smart "
"RTL（Rover、Copter）和地形跟随（Plane、Copter）几乎总需要禁用。这些功能通常默认启用，请设置 :ref:`SRTL_POINTS"
" <SRTL_POINTS>` = 0，:ref:`TERRAIN_ENABLE <TERRAIN_ENABLE>` = 0）。另见 :ref:`RAM"
" 限制 <ram_limitations>` 部分。"

