msgid ""
":code:`lat( [new_lat] )` - If called with no arguments, returns the current "
"latitude in degrees * 1e7 as an integer. If called with one argument, it "
"will assign the value to the latitude."
msgstr ""
":code:`lat( [new_lat] )` - 如果不带参数调用，则以整数形式返回当前纬度（度 * "
"1e7）。如果带一个参数调用，则将该值赋给纬度。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:153
