#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:21
#: 02b0153863c24b82bba56def68324256 1a44ae2957294f4c9a07d1960cabef54
#: 7015c389ce4e4cd4bf7071c6d2224138 7679909245a74e9488b255eec68c89fa
#: b96fc9c84cb044a79675b21ae1e26218
msgid ""
"Ensure your autopilot has at least 2 MB of flash and 80 kB of memory.  "
"Higher end 3MB autopilots with redundant IMUs will certainly work well but "
"verify the specifications needed for your :ref:`autopilot <common-"
"autopilots>` since even less expensive units with 2MB of flash will work "
"also. Scripting is not available in F4 based autopilots."
msgstr ""
"确保你的飞控至少具有 2 MB flash 和 80 kB 内存。配备冗余 IMU 的高端 3MB 飞控当然能很好地工作，但请核实你的 :ref:`飞控"
" <common-autopilots>` 所需的规格，因为即使是较便宜的 2MB flash 型号也同样可用。基于 F4 的飞控不支持脚本功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:22
#: 2b43957bfb314cc496aa58ba4ede1a91 44eb80700e474125840e2b0f93c499cf
#: 6a96ffbf3f5a4eebb5e42182a2004c8e ac3451f3580542d398af2770b0677aaa
#: be67cb20db22402fbae5525f27ba2367
msgid ""
"Autopilots must have an SD card to store the script unless the user builds "
"his own firmware and embeds it directly in the firmware (see :ref:`common-"
"oem-customizations`), or certain dataflash logging chips are included on the"
" board. Check the autopilot's firmware limitation list to be sure int "
"includes ``AP_SCRIPTING_ENABLED`` (see :ref:`common-limited_firmware` for "
"directions on how to do this)"
msgstr ""
"除非用户自行编译固件并将脚本直接嵌入固件（参见 :ref:`common-oem-customizations`），或板上带有某些 dataflash "
"日志芯片，否则飞控必须有 SD 卡来存放脚本。请检查该飞控固件的限制列表，确认其包含 ``AP_SCRIPTING_ENABLED`` （具体做法参见 "
":ref:`common-limited_firmware`）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:42
#: 0ac323d9ccd14303a95efef1e829ab50 6b16886944f9433f9bb092afd7faf6be
#: 87e219fe5402457dbbbd8ada5fa82800 dc9bf2e08c454fa983a261483dbe5c3d
#: e6cfefb0d61a46a9996192c0e3e16a0d
msgid ""
"Up to 8 RC channels can be assigned as scripting inputs/controls using the "
"``RCX_OPTION`` = \"300-307\" options to be used by scripts. In addition, six"
" dedicated script parameters are available: :ref:`SCR_USER1<SCR_USER1>` thru"
" :ref:`SCR_USER6<SCR_USER6>` and are accessed with the same method as any "
"other parameter, but these are reserved for script use. Scripts can also "
"generate their own parameters (see :ref:`common-scripting-parameters`)to be "
"used within the scripts."
msgstr ""
"最多可通过 ``RCX_OPTION`` = \"300-307\" 选项将 8 个 RC "
"通道指定为脚本的输入/控制，供脚本使用。此外，还提供六个专用脚本参数：:ref:`SCR_USER1<SCR_USER1>` 至 "
":ref:`SCR_USER6<SCR_USER6>`，其访问方式与其他参数相同，但这些参数保留供脚本使用。脚本也可以生成自己的参数（参见 "
":ref:`common-scripting-parameters`）供脚本内部使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:47
#: 0a6e8a3ee6674569812ba679fbb7dc99 297b49ed9d4845ca90333423f380bdb4
#: 2cbfbb622f2d4f3db0bdfaee7990ca2c 5786954fa5fa44c58f3154e052d3c0d5
#: 9af6caed641d41eaae5d793701c23dab
msgid ""
"upon script load, if insufficient memory has been allocated, an error "
"message will be sent to the GCS. Unfortunately, eliminating this by changing"
" the :ref:`SCR_HEAP_SIZE <SCR_HEAP_SIZE>` does not guarantee that while "
"running after aming, the LUA script could require even more and fail. In "
"order to mitigate this, ArduPilot in versions 4.7 and later, will "
"automatically try to increase the allocated memory and print a warning "
"message to the GCS to allow the user to resize before the next arm, but if "
"the additional memory is NOT available, the script will still fail."
msgstr ""
"脚本加载时，若分配的内存不足，会向 GCS 发送一条错误消息。遗憾的是，通过修改 :ref:`SCR_HEAP_SIZE "
"<SCR_HEAP_SIZE>` 消除该错误并不能保证解锁后运行期间 LUA 脚本不会需要更多内存而失败。为缓解此问题，ArduPilot 在 4.7 "
"及更高版本中会自动尝试增加分配的内存，并向 GCS 打印警告消息，以便用户在下次解锁前调整大小；但若额外的内存不可用，脚本仍会失败。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:65
#: 45b59f81780c4008b46e8cd86520b696 6317a32c70874bb59e9455eb0f1401cd
#: 927817608e5245218b0852dc564d4e76 cfaa20f80ef94958bb98a6a12486b1b2
#: d4298530d3584ebbb554b1ae9422a36f
msgid ""
"Communicate with DroneCAN peripherals (see `DroneCAN example "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/examples/DroneCAN_test.lua>`__)"
msgstr ""
"与 DroneCAN 外设通信（参见 `DroneCAN 示例 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/examples/DroneCAN_test.lua>`__）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:128
#: 385f103391de4958a73f559b9f27f7f7 a4ae9bdbf7a84d259de51047617fe857
#: acd4e42dff0945c999b6179d0e59e5ae aece046960594d75a88e5ac6c10c6e3e
#: f3c38b279bf6401b85f54572c2f12241
msgid ""
"In addition to creating accessing ArduPilot parameter values, and creating "
"new parameters dedicated to a script's operation, up to 16 :ref:`Auxiliary "
"switches <common-auxiliary-functions>` state can be read from a script. And "
"auxiliary switch function \"316\" can be used to stop or restart scripting "
"from the RC transmitter or GCS."
msgstr ""
"除了访问 ArduPilot 参数值以及创建脚本运行专用的新参数外，脚本还可读取最多 16 个 :ref:`辅助开关 <common-"
"auxiliary-functions>` 的状态。辅助开关功能 \"316\" 可用于从遥控器或 GCS 停止或重启脚本。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:503
#: 2c955efd436c4f7e8e5f0afd6a0d241a 66101dd3209b47b0bc21de62d505b96c
#: 875fc154c42e4ce8901b612165bafbea a2ee621cd1914607a54c4c069ae2d2da
#: d5ebe3eac6694e43a4f9a9bbe0f7e9e7
msgid ""
"``port:configure_parity(mode)`` - Configure the UART parity mode for "
"scripting protocol ports (those from ``find_serial``). No effect for device "
"simulation ports (those from ``find_simulated_device``). A value of 0 "
"disables parity (default), 1 enables odd parity, and 2 enables even parity. "
"An internal UART restart may occur when this setting is applied."
msgstr ""
"``port:configure_parity(mode)`` - 配置脚本协议端口（来自 ``find_serial`` 的端口）的 UART "
"校验模式。对设备仿真端口（来自 ``find_simulated_device`` 的端口）无效。值为 0 时禁用校验（默认），1 启用奇校验，2 "
"启用偶校验。应用此设置时可能会发生内部 UART 重启。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:505
