msgid ""
"``port:set_stop_bits(count)`` - Set the UART stop bit configuration for "
"scripting protocol ports. No effect for device simulation ports. A value of "
"1 selects one stop bit (default), and a value of 2 selects two stop bits. "
"Invalid values are ignored."
msgstr ""
"``port:set_stop_bits(count)`` - 设置脚本协议端口的 UART 停止位配置。对设备仿真端口无效。值为 1 "
"时选择一个停止位（默认），值为 2 时选择两个停止位。无效值将被忽略。"
